{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"nine-mens-morris UI copy.details","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"nine-mens-morris.copy.details","keys":["nine-mens-morris.copy.details"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Duk mai wasa yana sanya kwalaye tara a lokaci guda. Bayan sanyawa, ka motsa wani kwale a kan wani layi da aka nuna zuwa wani wuri da ke kusa wanda babu komai a ciki. Idan kana da kwalaye uku daidai, wannan sigar na ba ka damar tashi zuwa wani wuri da babu komai a ciki. Yi amfani da wani kwalba na cire kwalban mai adawa daya. Za ka lashe ta hanyar rage mai adawa zuwa kwalaye biyu ko kuma ka bar su ba tare da wata motsi ba. Matsayin da aka sake yi ko kuma iyaka na ZXQPH0000QXZ-shigo na nufin an yi daidai.","record_id":"00a717214d50a9b04a40cc1a6ed57b47ba8eb993e8f3389eb28b789e4c0bfd7a","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":2.8429327147499635,"source":"Each player places nine pieces in turn. After placement, move one piece along a marked line to a neighboring empty point. If you have exactly three pieces, this version lets you fly to any empty point. Forming a mill removes one opponent piece. You win by reducing the opponent to two pieces or leaving them with no legal move. A repeated position or 200-turn limit is a draw.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"94bcf79f949c5c356bee432117345f05fed6ef0d578c713237ea702c39b10360","status":"needs-review","translation":"Duk mai wasa yana sanya kwalaye tara a lokaci guda. Bayan sanyawa, ka motsa wani kwale a kan wani layi da aka nuna zuwa wani wuri da ke kusa wanda babu komai a ciki. Idan kana da kwalaye uku daidai, wannan sigar na ba ka damar tashi zuwa wani wuri da babu komai a ciki. Yi amfani da wani kwalba na cire kwalban m